---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/u, '');
const home = `${base}/ru/`;
const canonical = `https://poliklot.github.io${base}/404.html`;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru" data-theme="dark">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#1e1e1e" />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <link rel="icon" href={`${base}/assets/brand/bridge-mark.svg`} />
    <title>Страница не найдена · BRIDGE</title>
    <style>
      :root { color-scheme: dark; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      body { min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; background: #1e1e1e; color: #f5f5f5; }
      main { display: grid; min-height: 100vh; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; width: min(100%, 74rem); margin: auto; padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
      header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .08em; }
      header img { width: 2.2rem; height: 2.2rem; }
      section { display: grid; align-content: center; max-width: 54rem; padding-block: 4rem; }
      p:first-child { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #70c3ff; font: 700 .75rem ui-monospace, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      h1 { max-width: 12ch; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 7.5rem); line-height: .92; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
      section > p:not(:first-child) { max-width: 54ch; margin: 1.5rem 0 0; color: #b8b8b8; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.18rem); line-height: 1.65; }
      a { display: inline-flex; width: fit-content; min-height: 2.75rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 2rem; border-radius: .35rem; background: #0d99ff; padding: .75rem 1rem; color: #06131c; font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none; }
      a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #f5f5f5; outline-offset: 4px; }
      footer { border-top: 1px solid #3f3f3f; padding-top: 1rem; color: #8f8f8f; font: .72rem ui-monospace, monospace; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <header><img src={`${base}/assets/brand/bridge-mark.svg`} alt="" />BRIDGE</header>
      <section>
        <p>404 · путь не найден</p>
        <h1>Здесь нет страницы.</h1>
        <p>Адрес мог измениться. Вернитесь к карте BRIDGE и продолжите с нужной задачи.</p>
        <a href={home}>Открыть BRIDGE <span aria-hidden="true">&nbsp;→</span></a>
      </section>
      <footer lang="en">Page not found · Return to the BRIDGE documentation.</footer>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
